<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Ipioca</Major>
    <Description>An simple Assassin normal attacks to build poison stacks,

 This macro uses only 2 skills being it Slash and Shuriken:Venom.


Hold your choosen button to begin and release it to stop.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 34 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 34 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 32 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 32 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blade &amp; Soul NEO</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>